// merged data.
//
// Asura Strike (`MO_EXTREMITYFIST`, 271) has no `SKILL_EFFECT_INFO_LIST` entry;
// the original client hard-codes it (EF_BEGINASURA, 1 s, RagEffect.cpp:14187):
//   - two `effect\\ring_white.tga` waves + EF_BeginSpell.wav at the cast start,
//   - the six kanji of 阿修羅覇凰拳 (effect\asura1..6.tga) as huge dark glyphs;
//     in the original they appear one after another during the cast (with a
//     cast time; instant casts skip them), and
//   - the impact flash at the strike.
// The textures are white with alpha; the client renders them dark, which is
// why the glyphs are tinted near-black instead of additive.
